01:26:52.458 --> 01:26:55.086
alphabetical by city,

01:26:55.086 --> 01:26:57.421
and my pager will

01:26:55.086 --> 01:26:57.421
always go off during dinner.

01:26:57.421 --> 01:26:59.006
(PAGER BEEPS)

01:27:01.216 --> 01:27:05.429
You can switch off pager.

01:27:05.429 --> 01:27:07.389
I wish I could.

01:27:07.389 --> 01:27:10.893
I've been waiting

01:27:07.389 --> 01:27:10.893
for a phone call

01:27:07.389 --> 01:27:10.893
for seven years.

01:27:10.893 --> 01:27:13.312
I know it's coming, Viktor.

01:27:13.312 --> 01:27:15.982
That's why I

01:27:13.312 --> 01:27:15.982
can't break it off.

01:27:15.982 --> 01:27:18.776
That's why I live

01:27:15.982 --> 01:27:18.776
out of hotels

01:27:18.776 --> 01:27:21.195
and have my little suitcase

01:27:18.776 --> 01:27:21.195
packed, ready to go,

01:27:21.195 --> 01:27:24.448
just in case

01:27:21.195 --> 01:27:24.448
he wants to meet

01:27:21.195 --> 01:27:24.448
me for the weekend.

01:27:24.448 --> 01:27:27.160
Yeah.

01:27:27.160 --> 01:27:29.286
I've been

01:27:27.160 --> 01:27:29.286
waiting my whole life.

01:27:32.456 --> 01:27:33.833
Just don't know

01:27:32.456 --> 01:27:33.833
what the hell for.

01:27:33.833 --> 01:27:35.250
(PAGER VIBRATES)

01:27:38.796 --> 01:27:40.798
I'm so sorry.

01:27:58.732 --> 01:28:01.027
I live here.

01:28:01.027 --> 01:28:02.611
What?

01:28:02.611 --> 01:28:03.821
I live here, in terminal.

01:28:03.821 --> 01:28:05.364
Gate 67.

01:28:06.490 --> 01:28:07.741
You live at the airport?

01:28:07.741 --> 01:28:09.660
Yes. Day and night.

01:28:09.660 --> 01:28:13.247
This home, like you.

01:28:09.660 --> 01:28:13.247
They tell me to wait.

01:28:13.247 --> 01:28:15.249
So I wait.

01:28:15.249 --> 01:28:18.252
All frequent fliers

01:28:15.249 --> 01:28:18.252
feel the same

01:28:15.249 --> 01:28:18.252
way you do, Viktor.

01:28:18.252 --> 01:28:20.713
Everybody's waiting.

01:28:18.252 --> 01:28:20.713
Everybody.

01:28:18.252 --> 01:28:20.713
No.

01:28:20.713 --> 01:28:22.882
For a flight,

01:28:20.713 --> 01:28:22.882
for a meeting...

01:28:20.713 --> 01:28:22.882
No, no, no.

01:28:22.882 --> 01:28:25.134
I don't wait for flight.

01:28:22.882 --> 01:28:25.134
I don't wait for meeting.

01:28:25.134 --> 01:28:26.719
Then what are

01:28:25.134 --> 01:28:26.719
you waiting for?

01:28:26.719 --> 01:28:28.137
(PAGER BEEPS)

01:28:30.764 --> 01:28:33.767
Is okay. I understand.

01:28:37.563 --> 01:28:39.773
I have an idea.

01:28:39.773 --> 01:28:41.734
Come here.

01:28:41.734 --> 01:28:44.195
(STAMMERING) What you do?

01:28:44.195 --> 01:28:45.487
(GASPS)

01:28:45.487 --> 01:28:47.073
You sure?

01:28:47.073 --> 01:28:49.158
More than anything,

01:28:47.073 --> 01:28:49.158
I'm sure of this, Viktor.

01:28:49.158 --> 01:28:51.869
Ready?

01:28:51.869 --> 01:28:53.579
(GRUNTS)

01:28:56.999 --> 01:28:58.834
(BOTH LAUGH)

01:29:06.884 --> 01:29:09.887
VIKTOR:

01:29:06.884 --> 01:29:09.887
So, when do you come back?

01:29:09.887 --> 01:29:13.307
AMELIA: 13 days.

01:29:09.887 --> 01:29:13.307
How about you?

01:29:13.307 --> 01:29:16.227
VIKTOR: I... I will be here.

01:29:16.227 --> 01:29:19.105
AMELIA: But what if

01:29:16.227 --> 01:29:19.105
your schedule changes?

01:29:19.105 --> 01:29:21.274
Maybe we should

01:29:19.105 --> 01:29:21.274
exchange phone numbers.

01:29:21.274 --> 01:29:24.318
VIKTOR: No. I will be here.

01:29:24.318 --> 01:29:30.241
You know what Napoleon

01:29:24.318 --> 01:29:30.241
give to Josephine

01:29:24.318 --> 01:29:30.241
when he win Bavaria?

01:29:30.241 --> 01:29:32.868
Tell me.

01:29:32.868 --> 01:29:34.536
Oh, come on. Tell me.

01:29:34.536 --> 01:29:39.499
I will show you.

01:29:34.536 --> 01:29:39.499
13 days from now.

01:29:39.499 --> 01:29:40.876
Hmm?

01:29:50.719 --> 01:29:52.054
(CAMERA WHIRS)

01:30:09.738 --> 01:30:11.073
(FLUSHES)

01:30:48.110 --> 01:30:49.528
What's he doing?

01:30:49.528 --> 01:30:51.071
I can't ask him

01:30:49.528 --> 01:30:51.071
what he's doing.

01:30:51.071 --> 01:30:53.407
I'm supposed to tell him

01:30:51.071 --> 01:30:53.407
what he's doing.

01:30:53.407 --> 01:30:55.534
If I ask him,

01:30:53.407 --> 01:30:55.534
I look like an idiot.

01:31:03.417 --> 01:31:05.002
(SPEAKING SPANISH)

01:31:13.093 --> 01:31:17.181
I'm sorry. Sorry.

01:31:13.093 --> 01:31:17.181
Please, you got to

01:31:13.093 --> 01:31:17.181
do this for me.

01:31:17.181 --> 01:31:20.767
I promise you're gonna get

01:31:17.181 --> 01:31:20.767
really fat with all the food

01:31:17.181 --> 01:31:20.767
I'm going to give you.

01:31:20.767 --> 01:31:24.897
But, please, do this for me.

01:31:20.767 --> 01:31:24.897
It will be the last

01:31:20.767 --> 01:31:24.897
thing I ask you to do.

01:31:43.916 --> 01:31:48.045
He waits for you

01:31:43.916 --> 01:31:48.045
to answer at Sbarro.

01:31:52.425 --> 01:31:55.219
I have to work.

01:31:55.219 --> 01:31:57.263
He will wait.

01:32:38.471 --> 01:32:39.805
(CHEERING)

01:32:48.688 --> 01:32:50.023
(VIKTOR CHUCKLES)

01:32:55.195 --> 01:32:56.905
(INDISTINCT CONVERSATIONS)

01:33:01.160 --> 01:33:02.828
How was your flight?

01:33:01.160 --> 01:33:02.828
Good.

01:33:04.246 --> 01:33:06.248
Thanks.

01:33:10.461 --> 01:33:12.338
Is something wrong?

01:33:12.338 --> 01:33:14.173
You'll have to

01:33:12.338 --> 01:33:14.173
come with us, ma'am.

01:33:14.173 --> 01:33:15.549
You gotta be kidding.

01:33:15.549 --> 01:33:17.717
I come through here

01:33:15.549 --> 01:33:17.717
twice a month.

01:33:17.717 --> 01:33:19.886
Please follow me.

01:33:17.717 --> 01:33:19.886
(SIGHS)

01:33:19.886 --> 01:33:22.348
I'm supposed to be

01:33:19.886 --> 01:33:22.348
meeting somebody.

01:33:30.105 --> 01:33:32.399
(P.A. CHIMES)

01:33:32.399 --> 01:33:34.276
(MAN SPEAKING

01:33:32.399 --> 01:33:34.276
INDISTINCTLY ON P.A.)

01:33:45.245 --> 01:33:48.707
DIXON:<i> In my line of work,</i>

01:33:45.245 --> 01:33:48.707
<i>there are three</i>

01:33:45.245 --> 01:33:48.707
<i>things that matter.</i>

01:33:48.707 --> 01:33:53.795
The person,

01:33:48.707 --> 01:33:53.795
the document and the story.

01:33:55.506 --> 01:33:59.510
Find the truth of one,

01:33:55.506 --> 01:33:59.510
and you find

01:33:55.506 --> 01:33:59.510
the truth of all three.

01:33:59.510 --> 01:34:02.471
I need your help

01:33:59.510 --> 01:34:02.471
finding the truth.

01:34:03.847 --> 01:34:06.850
Do you know a man

01:34:03.847 --> 01:34:06.850
named Viktor Navorski?

01:34:06.850 --> 01:34:08.810
Yes.

01:34:08.810 --> 01:34:12.481
Do you know why he's here

01:34:08.810 --> 01:34:12.481
and where he's from?

01:34:12.481 --> 01:34:15.442
No. We're just friends.

01:34:15.442 --> 01:34:18.028
Have you noticed

01:34:15.442 --> 01:34:18.028
that he hides a can

01:34:18.028 --> 01:34:21.365
of Planters dry roasted

01:34:18.028 --> 01:34:21.365
peanuts in his bag?

01:34:21.365 --> 01:34:23.283
So?

01:34:23.283 --> 01:34:24.618
What do you make of that?

01:34:24.618 --> 01:34:26.745
(CHUCKLES)

01:34:26.745 --> 01:34:29.206
I'd make peanut butter,

01:34:26.745 --> 01:34:29.206
I guess.

01:34:26.745 --> 01:34:29.206
(CHUCKLES)

01:34:31.166 --> 01:34:32.543
We know that

01:34:31.166 --> 01:34:32.543
he's planning to go

01:34:32.543 --> 01:34:35.128
to the Ramada Inn

01:34:32.543 --> 01:34:35.128
on Lexington.

01:34:35.128 --> 01:34:37.130
Has he told you

01:34:35.128 --> 01:34:37.130
why he's in New York?

01:34:37.130 --> 01:34:38.798
No.

01:34:38.798 --> 01:34:40.759
Has he told you

01:34:38.798 --> 01:34:40.759
where he lives?

01:34:40.759 --> 01:34:42.844
No.

01:34:40.759 --> 01:34:42.844
We just met at the airport.

01:34:42.844 --> 01:34:45.264
All I know is that

01:34:42.844 --> 01:34:45.264
he's a building contractor,

01:34:45.264 --> 01:34:46.890
living out of a suitcase.

01:34:46.890 --> 01:34:48.141
That's it.

01:34:48.141 --> 01:34:49.435
He's a contractor?

01:34:49.435 --> 01:34:50.685
Yeah.

01:34:50.685 --> 01:34:53.188
That's what he said?

01:34:50.685 --> 01:34:53.188
Mmm-hmm.

01:34:55.690 --> 01:34:59.486
Amelia. I'm just curious.

01:34:59.486 --> 01:35:04.199
You are the kind of woman

01:34:59.486 --> 01:35:04.199
who can get any guy she wants.

01:35:06.826 --> 01:35:10.789
Why Viktor Navorski?

01:35:10.789 --> 01:35:15.419
That's something

01:35:10.789 --> 01:35:15.419
a guy like you

01:35:10.789 --> 01:35:15.419
could never understand.

01:35:38.358 --> 01:35:41.069
I guess you missed

01:35:38.358 --> 01:35:41.069
your flight again.

01:35:41.069 --> 01:35:43.363
Or maybe you have

01:35:41.069 --> 01:35:43.363
a bad travel agent.

01:35:43.363 --> 01:35:45.574
Please. Please. Sit.

01:35:45.574 --> 01:35:48.743
It's okay, Viktor.

01:35:45.574 --> 01:35:48.743
All men lie.

01:35:48.743 --> 01:35:50.579
At least you're

01:35:48.743 --> 01:35:50.579
not very good at it.

01:35:50.579 --> 01:35:52.706
I did not lie.

01:35:52.706 --> 01:35:57.210
You told me you were delayed.

01:35:52.706 --> 01:35:57.210
You never said it

01:35:52.706 --> 01:35:57.210
was for nine months.

01:35:57.210 --> 01:36:00.589
Maybe you see the man

01:35:57.210 --> 01:36:00.589
the way you want see the man.

01:36:00.589 --> 01:36:03.925
So, what am I seeing?

01:36:00.589 --> 01:36:03.925
Who are you?

01:36:04.926 --> 01:36:06.178
I...

01:36:06.178 --> 01:36:07.554
Unacceptable?

01:36:07.554 --> 01:36:10.056
Yes. Yes.

01:36:10.056 --> 01:36:12.809
You want to hear

01:36:10.056 --> 01:36:12.809
the funny part?

01:36:12.809 --> 01:36:14.769
I broke up with him.

01:36:14.769 --> 01:36:17.481
I was coming here to tell you

01:36:14.769 --> 01:36:17.481
that he's out of my life.

01:36:17.481 --> 01:36:21.568
I'm free.

01:36:17.481 --> 01:36:21.568
I got tired of waiting.

01:36:21.568 --> 01:36:23.945
At least we have

01:36:21.568 --> 01:36:23.945
that in common.

01:36:27.991 --> 01:36:34.498
Amelia, you know what Napoleon

01:36:27.991 --> 01:36:34.498
give to Josephine

01:36:27.991 --> 01:36:34.498
when he win Bavaria?

01:36:35.666 --> 01:36:37.209
(WHISPERS) No.

01:36:37.209 --> 01:36:39.878
I show you.

01:36:39.878 --> 01:36:41.838
(FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING)

01:36:43.840 --> 01:36:46.051
Please. Please.

01:36:49.680 --> 01:36:52.140
Sit. Please.

01:37:03.485 --> 01:37:08.156
That was gift.

01:37:03.485 --> 01:37:08.156
Napoleon to Josephine.

01:37:08.156 --> 01:37:12.118
One thousand fountains.

01:37:12.118 --> 01:37:14.287
You built this for me?

01:37:14.287 --> 01:37:18.458
Please. Sit. Sit.

01:37:14.287 --> 01:37:18.458
Don't get wet.

01:37:20.293 --> 01:37:21.795
(VIKTOR STRAINS)

01:37:28.635 --> 01:37:30.345
VIKTOR: Come on.

01:37:32.013 --> 01:37:34.433
Oh... (SPEAKS BULGARIAN)

01:37:34.433 --> 01:37:35.934
It no work.

01:37:35.934 --> 01:37:40.980
It should shoot,

01:37:35.934 --> 01:37:40.980
big water up to ceiling.

01:37:42.190 --> 01:37:45.235
Just tell me the truth.

01:37:45.235 --> 01:37:47.446
Did you escape

01:37:45.235 --> 01:37:47.446
from an institution?

01:37:49.489 --> 01:37:50.907
Huh?

01:37:50.907 --> 01:37:53.243
Are you a criminal?

01:37:55.995 --> 01:37:57.997
You're living here, Viktor.

01:37:57.997 --> 01:38:01.167
You're living at Gate 67.

01:37:57.997 --> 01:38:01.167
I just want to know why.

01:38:01.167 --> 01:38:03.545
Here. I show you.

01:38:15.390 --> 01:38:17.350
My father.

01:38:17.350 --> 01:38:18.811
Oh, God, Viktor,

01:38:17.350 --> 01:38:18.811
please tell me

01:38:18.811 --> 01:38:21.062
your father isn't

01:38:18.811 --> 01:38:21.062
in that peanut can.

01:38:27.944 --> 01:38:30.572
This is jazz.

01:38:36.578 --> 01:38:39.706
My father,

01:38:36.578 --> 01:38:39.706
Dimitar Asenov Navorski,

01:38:39.706 --> 01:38:45.671
see this photograph

01:38:39.706 --> 01:38:45.671
in Hungarian newspaper, 1958.

01:38:45.671 --> 01:38:48.590
He say he look at photograph

01:38:45.671 --> 01:38:48.590
for seven days.

01:38:48.590 --> 01:38:50.759
Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday...

01:38:50.759 --> 01:38:53.345
Who are they?

01:38:50.759 --> 01:38:53.345
Oh.

01:38:53.345 --> 01:38:56.640
Count Basie, Dizzy Gillespie,

01:38:53.345 --> 01:38:56.640
Thelonious Monk,

01:38:53.345 --> 01:38:56.640
Sonny Rollins,

01:38:56.640 --> 01:38:58.851
Art Blakey, Max Kaminsky.

01:38:58.851 --> 01:39:02.312
57 of them all together.

01:39:02.312 --> 01:39:06.024
After looking at photograph

01:39:02.312 --> 01:39:06.024
for seven days,

01:39:02.312 --> 01:39:06.024
my father has idea.

01:39:06.024 --> 01:39:08.276
He begin to write

01:39:06.024 --> 01:39:08.276
letters to club,

01:39:08.276 --> 01:39:11.321
New York, Lickety Split,

01:39:08.276 --> 01:39:11.321
Snookie's Sugar Bowl.

01:39:11.321 --> 01:39:16.535
He ask the nuns

01:39:11.321 --> 01:39:16.535
to write English.

01:39:11.321 --> 01:39:16.535
Hundreds letters.

01:39:16.535 --> 01:39:19.454
And then he wait.

01:39:19.454 --> 01:39:23.375
He wait month, week, year.

01:39:23.375 --> 01:39:27.462
My father wait 40 year.

01:39:30.465 --> 01:39:33.760
And they all sign names.

01:39:36.054 --> 01:39:38.014
One by one.

01:39:54.197 --> 01:39:59.369
They all write their name

01:39:54.197 --> 01:39:59.369
and send it to my father.

01:40:04.708 --> 01:40:07.252
All but not one.

01:40:08.962 --> 01:40:11.381
Benny Golson.

01:40:14.175 --> 01:40:16.887
Saxophone.

01:40:16.887 --> 01:40:19.389
My father die

01:40:16.887 --> 01:40:19.389
before Benny Golson

01:40:19.389 --> 01:40:22.016
write his name

01:40:19.389 --> 01:40:22.016
and send to my father.

01:40:22.016 --> 01:40:26.271
So I make him promise.

01:40:22.016 --> 01:40:26.271
I keep promise.

01:40:29.983 --> 01:40:35.572
I promise I will go New York,

01:40:29.983 --> 01:40:35.572
find Benny Golson,

01:40:35.572 --> 01:40:38.450
have him write

01:40:35.572 --> 01:40:38.450
name to put in can.

01:40:38.450 --> 01:40:43.288
And you've been living here

01:40:38.450 --> 01:40:43.288
all this time so you could

01:40:38.450 --> 01:40:43.288
do this for your father?

01:40:43.288 --> 01:40:46.249
Maybe I think

01:40:43.288 --> 01:40:46.249
he do it for me.

01:40:51.922 --> 01:40:57.218
You say you are

01:40:51.922 --> 01:40:57.218
waiting for something.

01:40:57.218 --> 01:41:01.347
And I say to you, "Yes, yes.

01:40:57.218 --> 01:41:01.347
We all wait."

01:41:04.225 --> 01:41:06.102
What are you waiting for?

01:41:08.480 --> 01:41:12.484
You. I wait for you.

01:42:09.499 --> 01:42:11.501
What?

01:42:15.463 --> 01:42:18.008
The war is over.

01:42:18.008 --> 01:42:19.551
<i>...the right</i>

01:42:18.008 --> 01:42:19.551
<i>wing military coup</i>

01:42:19.551 --> 01:42:21.344
<i>that ousted</i>

01:42:19.551 --> 01:42:21.344
<i>President Vagobagin...</i>

01:42:21.344 --> 01:42:24.639
(ALL SING THE KRAKOZHIAN

01:42:21.344 --> 01:42:24.639
NATIONAL ANTHEM IN BULGARIAN)

01:42:48.246 --> 01:42:51.457
All right, everybody.

01:42:48.246 --> 01:42:51.457
Come on.

01:42:48.246 --> 01:42:51.457
Let's raise your glasses.

01:42:51.457 --> 01:42:55.169
Let's have

01:42:51.457 --> 01:42:55.169
a toast to my friend,

01:42:51.457 --> 01:42:55.169
Viktor "The Goat."

01:42:55.169 --> 01:42:57.714
(BLEATS)

01:42:55.169 --> 01:42:57.714
(ALL BLEAT)

01:42:57.714 --> 01:42:59.966
May he never lose

01:42:57.714 --> 01:42:59.966
his country again.

01:42:57.714 --> 01:42:59.966
(GUFFAWS)

01:42:59.966 --> 01:43:02.135
Krakozhia.

01:43:02.135 --> 01:43:06.014
Amelia. Amelia.

01:43:02.135 --> 01:43:06.014
You... You...

01:43:02.135 --> 01:43:06.014
You here early.

01:43:06.014 --> 01:43:08.266
Hello. Amelia. Oh, look.

01:43:08.266 --> 01:43:10.476
Peace.

01:43:08.266 --> 01:43:10.476
Peace. The war. The war.

01:43:08.266 --> 01:43:10.476
Please come. Come.

01:43:10.476 --> 01:43:14.022
See, the war,

01:43:10.476 --> 01:43:14.022
the war Krakozhia is over.

01:43:14.022 --> 01:43:16.608
Peace. The war is over.

01:43:20.820 --> 01:43:22.530
You know my friend?

01:43:20.820 --> 01:43:22.530
Yes.

01:43:22.530 --> 01:43:24.116
He works...

01:43:22.530 --> 01:43:24.116
He works in Washington.

01:43:22.530 --> 01:43:24.116
Yes, yes.

01:43:24.116 --> 01:43:26.659
He has a lot of connections.

01:43:24.116 --> 01:43:26.659
Here.

01:43:24.116 --> 01:43:26.659
Oh.

01:43:26.659 --> 01:43:28.828
It's a pass, Viktor.

01:43:28.828 --> 01:43:31.790
A one-day

01:43:28.828 --> 01:43:31.790
